@animalId = cmk866o3g0000lafc0l451uu3

### Auth ping (no token)
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/auth/ping

### Get dev token
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/auth/dev-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+79990001122"
}

### Auth ping (with token manual)
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/auth/ping
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJkZXYtdXNlciIsInBob25lRTE2NCI6Iis3OTk5MDAwMTEyMiIsImlhdCI6MTc2ODI0MDA5OH0.VU0d34jlFeo1XL0jFTq-pJXUdXXCXHUaU1kKi8G5sCw

### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/health

### Create animal
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/ingest/animal
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Барсик",
  "species": "cat",
  "breed": "mixed",
  "birthDate": "2022-05-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "microchipId": "RU-123-456-789",
  "microchipStandard": "ISO11784/11785",
  "microchipSource": "CLINIC"
}

### Create event (replace animalId)
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/ingest/event
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "animalId": "cmk866o3g0000lafc0l451uu3",
  "clinic": { "name": "HappyVet", "externalKey": "happyvet-001" },
  "type": "VACCINATION",
  "occurredAt": "2026-01-10T10:30:00.000Z",
  "source": "CLINIC",
  "data": {
    "vaccine": "Rabies",
    "batch": "RB-2026-01",
    "nextDueAt": "2027-01-10T00:00:00.000Z",
    "notes": "No adverse reactions"
  }
}

### Timeline (replace id)
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/animals/{{animalId}}/timeline

### Start OTP
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/auth/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "89990001122"
}

### Verify OTP
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/auth/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "89990001122",
  "code": "123456"
}

### Create animal linked to owner phone
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/ingest/animal
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Барсик",
  "species": "cat",
  "breed": "mixed",
  "birthDate": "2022-05-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "microchipId": "RU-123-456-789",
  "microchipStandard": "ISO11784/11785",
  "microchipSource": "CLINIC",
  "ownerPhone": "89990001122"
}

### My animals (вставь token из auth/verify)
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/me/animals
Authorization: Bearer ВСТАВЬ_ТОКЕН_СЮДА
